start: mr
R1: C1@{3ch=dc {3dc ch [4dc ch]x3}@ring} ss@top fo
R2: C2@{sl@sp 3ch=dc {3dc ch 4dc}@same ch [{4dc ch 4dc}@sp ch]x3} ss@top fo
R3: C3@{3ch=dc {2ch dc}@same [4dc dc@sp 4dc {dc 2ch dc}@corner]x3 4dc dc@sp 4dc} ss@top fo # sides: 1 dc in each dc and in the side ch-1 sp
R4: C4@{3ch=dc {3dc ch 4dc}@same ch [4sk 2dc@st ch 2dc@st ch 4sk {4dc ch 4dc}@corner ch]x3 4sk 2dc@st ch 2dc@st ch 4sk} ss@top fo
R5: C5@{3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same [[dc]>corner {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 [dc]>end} ss@top fo
